 "traps": [
  "members = [\"crates/*\"] is a glob; vendor/axoasset is a vendored crate outside the workspace, and ui/backend is excluded but absent from the tree",
  "every crate writes its dependencies as { workspace = true }: versions are in the root Cargo.toml, frameworks belong to the crates that name them",
  "gRPC comes from tonic in atuin-daemon and atuin-octavo, whose build.rs runs tonic-prost-build with protox; Protocol Buffers (prost) is also used by atuin-client and atuin-common",
  "the client keeps its history in SQLite through sqlx and rusqlite; the server accepts PostgreSQL, SQLite or MySQL by db_uri, with MySQL only in a commented line of server.toml and PostgreSQL in k8s/atuin.yaml",
  "rstest and proptest are dev-dependencies of almost every crate; wiremock only of atuin-client and atuin-domain",
  "Atuin Sync (api.atuin.sh) and Atuin Hub (hub.atuin.sh) are the project's hosted services, named only as default URLs in settings.rs",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
